{"unit_id":"saya-ch__dsh-mobile#feature-1","repo":"saya-ch/dsh-mobile","commit":"b829e50d6c86c96281c6fec379e2e6538e8fa0f4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「手机继续使用桌面会话」：手机浏览器或 Android App 连接电脑端 DSH 后，可继续使用相同的会话、工作区、消息和工具。通过移动访问入口配对并打开页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["README.md:49","README.md:57"]}
{"unit_id":"saya-ch__dsh-mobile#feature-2","repo":"saya-ch/dsh-mobile","commit":"b829e50d6c86c96281c6fec379e2e6538e8fa0f4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「局域网和远程连接」：提供局域网访问，也可配置 Tailscale Funnel、cpolar、cloudflared、自建 FRP、自有反向代理或实验性 iroh 等连接方式。用户在移动访问界面选择和配置通道。","source":"generated","evidence":["README.md:49","README.md:60"]}
{"unit_id":"saya-ch__dsh-mobile#feature-3","repo":"saya-ch/dsh-mobile","commit":"b829e50d6c86c96281c6fec379e2e6538e8fa0f4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「设备配对和管理」：支持通过扫码、链接或密钥配对，并在电脑端管理授权设备；Android App 可查看已配对电脑并进行切换、重新配对或删除本地记录。","source":"generated","evidence":["README.md:61"]}
{"unit_id":"saya-ch__dsh-mobile#feature-4","repo":"saya-ch/dsh-mobile","commit":"b829e50d6c86c96281c6fec379e2e6538e8fa0f4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「移动端布局」：针对手机重新组织会话抽屉、工具详情、设置、提问卡片和输入栏，并支持移动专属外观设置。客户端启动时安装对应界面组件。","source":"generated","evidence":["README.md:59","src/client.ts:14-20"]}
{"unit_id":"saya-ch__dsh-mobile#feature-5","repo":"saya-ch/dsh-mobile","commit":"b829e50d6c86c96281c6fec379e2e6538e8fa0f4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「连接诊断」：在移动访问界面检查版本、网关、网卡、防火墙和远程通道，并生成诊断报告，帮助定位连接问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["README.md:62"]}
{"unit_id":"saya-ch__dsh-mobile#feature-6","repo":"saya-ch/dsh-mobile","commit":"b829e50d6c86c96281c6fec379e2e6538e8fa0f4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「移动扩展与自定义」：用户可通过 DSH 对话定制移动界面，也可在移动扩展目录中增加页面或操作入口；插件为扩展提供请求和界面挂载上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["README.md:58","src/client.ts:93-101"]}
{"unit_id":"saya-ch__dsh-mobile#feature-7","repo":"saya-ch/dsh-mobile","commit":"b829e50d6c86c96281c6fec379e2e6538e8fa0f4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Mobile 的功能「iPhone/iPad 主屏幕网页应用」：在 Safari 中打开移动访问链接并完成配对后，可将页面添加到主屏幕，以 Web App 方式继续访问同一份 DSH 会话和工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["README.md:119-128"]}
